→ floating pins: wire them, or (where supported) mark intentional ones NC
→ net names: fix mismatched flags/ports/labels before treating schematic DRC as clean
→ marker overlap: net markers cover a part/each other — stagger the labels or re-run autoconnect with more offset
→ missing-partition: 多器件页没画功能分区框(铁律#15) — `sch zones set`→`sch zone-draw`(整纸版式 --mode partition);若 `sch zone-plan` 报 partitionOverlap,先 `sch zone-arrange --apply` 或拆页,再画
